spice
* NMOS Transistors
M1 2 5 5 5 NMOS
M2 7 2 5 5 NMOS

* PMOS Transistor
M3 4 2 3 3 PMOS

* Resistors
R01 4 0 r_01
R02 7 5 r_02
R03 2 3 r_03

* Current Source
I1 2 0 I_x

* Voltage Source
Vs 22 6 DC V_s

*.MODEL statements for transistors
.model NMOS NMOS (level=1)
.model PMOS PMOS (level=1)

.END